3](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/53) completed the fresh installed pipeline through billing, anonymous HF readback, cleanup and byte-inert replay. **Zero exports and zero independent exported-task controls**: the backport was filtered; the original had no failing-to-passing tests. Both completed suites imported the old guard under `site-packages` after the workspace patch applied. [Final evidence](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/blob/326e8e6f/experiments/53-installed-native/results.md). No accepted fresh task or population-yield claim.\n\n**Implementation:** open/unmerged [#46](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/46), drafts [#50](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/50) / [#52](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/52) supply validation, generation and held retention; [#55](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/55) removes local-transition sleeps (152 checks/CI green). #53 kept its frozen runtime/settings. Earlier #45/#47 failures remain preserved, not repaired into accepted scores.\n\n**Active comparison:** [#57](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/57) runs the same unchanged installed pipeline on two fresh official-listed Biopython PRs. Inputs/source/notices are frozen; the original reserved TRC job is confirmed running (22:24:39 UTC); native results and final billing are pending. No replacement PR, extra repair, #56 plugin or APT candidate.\n\n**Source follow-up:** [#56](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/56) reproduced editable-to-release replacement with real offline pip. A separate reporting-only plugin passes eight paired real pytest cases plus four real-installation invocations, preserving outcomes and failures. Exact AnnData transaction and full native source identity remain unproven; no runtime integration.\n\n**Budget/status:** settled **11.166263/32 allocated CPUh**, **$0.601629 / 20 original calls**, active #57 controller, 6.333333 CPUh and $13.07 generation/model reservations. The original native job is running; results and its final billing are pending. Reservations are not spend. Existing $10 archival reservation remains unreconciled. Same $90 operating ceiling, strictly below $100 extra, existing reserved CPUs only. Logs, manifests and accounting in comments.\n\nKeep epic/children/PRs open for review; main is unchanged, no automatic merge or dataset release. Original #28 stays closed at 83 exports / 82 ever-positive / 67 ever-clean, 25 public-eligible / 58 Matchms withheld. Scientific acceptance, workflow completion and release readiness remain separate.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}